        "text": "The oral argument before the Supreme Court began at 11:01\u202fa.m."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "8da5c9934ad25410b10c15b2235977ba1a56370776dd31d46e1e10919cb61033",
