            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court noted that many cases allow attorneys\u2019 fees as unsecured claims."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "8da5c9934ad25410b10c15b2235977ba1a56370776dd31d46e1e10919cb61033",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-8da5c9934ad2-0001-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 29,
              "start": 29
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court warned of an enormous amount of affirmative harm that could result if it overturns the Ninth Circuit\u2019s disallowance, and reserved an open question on the meaning of \u00a7\u00a7\u202f502(b) and\u202f506(b)."
