                "start": 5
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Travelers Casualty and Surety Company, any right to payment becomes a claim when the debtor files for bankruptcy."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Travelers Casualty and Surety Company",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "8da5c9934ad25410b10c15b2235977ba1a56370776dd31d46e1e10919cb61033",
